+use PHPUnit\Framework\TestCase;
+
+#[CoversClass(Order::class)]
+final class OrderRefundTest extends TestCase
+{
+    #[Test]
+    public function cancellingPaidOrderRecordsRefundOfPaidAmount(): void
+    {
+        $order = $this->confirmedOrder(100_00);
+        $order->markPaid();
+
+        $order->cancel('customer request', new \DateTimeImmutable());
+
+        self::assertSame(900_00, $order->refundDueInCents);
+    }
+
+    #[Test]
+    public function cancellingUnpaidOrderRecordsNoRefund(): void
+    {
+        $order = $this->confirmedOrder();
+
+        $order->cancel('customer request', new \DateTimeImmutable());
+
+        self::assertNull($order->refundDueInCents);
+    }
+
+    #[Test]
+    public function repeatedCancellationKeepsRefund(): void
+    {
+        $order = $this->confirmedOrder();
+        $order->markPaid();
+        $order->cancel('customer request', new \DateTimeImmutable());
+
+        $order->cancel('again', new \DateTimeImmutable());
+
+        self::assertSame(1000_00, $order->refundDueInCents);
+    }
+
+    private function confirmedOrder(int $discountInCents = 0): Order
+    {
+        $order = Order::place(OrderId::generate(), CustomerId::generate());
+        $order->addItem(ProductId::generate(), 2, new Money(500_00, Currency::CZK));
+        $order->applyDiscount(new Money($discountInCents, Currency::CZK));
+        $order->confirm();
+
+        return $order;
+    }
+}
# Ordering

Slovník: objednávka (`Order`), položka (`OrderItem`), storno (`cancel()`, `OrderCancelled`).
Pozor: rezervace ≠ storno. Rezervace zboží patří Inventory, ne Orderingu.

Veřejné pro ostatní kontexty: události v `Domain/Event` a ID (`OrderId`, `ProductId`, `CustomerId`).
Stará administrace (`src/Legacy`) smí jen na příkazy v `Application/Command`, ID a výjimky v `Domain/Exception`.
Inventory volat nesmíš, reaguje na události Orderingu.
Když Deptrac hlásí `… must not depend on … (InventoryDomain)`: neupravuj `deptrac.php`,
zaznamenej v `Order` událost a zbytek udělej v handleru událostí v `src/Inventory/Application/EventHandler`.
Stav objednávky mění jen doménové metody `Order` s `canTransitionTo()` a `record()`.

